# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages. Like _headers, this must land in the build
# output, so it lives in public/ and Vite copies it to dist/.
#
# Request resolution order on Pages:
#   1. Pages Functions (functions/)  <- /api/review and /api/contribute match here
#   2. static assets in dist/
#   3. these _redirects rules
# The catch-all below therefore cannot swallow /api/*.
#
# The app uses a HASH router (#/route), so the server almost always sees "/"
# already. This rule is the safety net for anyone who types or bookmarks a clean
# path, and it future-proofs a later move to real history routing.
/*    /index.html   200
